ll phone...","fa":"پاسپورت و گوشی …"},{"s":41.65,"e":44.07,"de":"Mein Hemd, ich hatte ein buntes Hemd.","en":"My shirt, I had a colorful shirt.","fa":"پیراهنم، یک پیراهن رنگارنگ داشتم."},{"s":44.09,"e":44.91,"de":"Das ist auch weg.","en":"That's gone, too.","fa":"آن هم گم شده."},{"s":44.91,"e":45.83,"de":"Das war mein Lieblingshemd.","en":"That was my favorite shirt.","fa":"پیراهن مورد علاقه‌ام بود."},{"s":46.23,"e":48.33,"de":"Ich habe eine Idee: Wir gehen in die Stadt und du kaufst","en":"I've got an idea: we're going to town and you're buying.","fa":"من یک ایده دارم: به شهر می‌رویم و تو"},{"s":48.36,"e":50.61,"de":"dir ein neues Hemd und einen warmen Pullover.","en":"a new shirt and a warm sweater.","fa":"برای خودت یک پیراهن جدید و یک پلیور گرم می‌خری."},{"s":51.07,"e":51.71,"de":"Hast du Lust?","en":"Do you want to?","fa":"حوصله‌اش را داری؟"},{"s":52.47,"e":53.95,"de":"Ich weiß, wo man günstig einkaufen kann.","en":"I know where to buy cheaply.","fa":"می‌دانم کجا می‌شود ارزان خرید."},{"s":54.17,"e":55.27,"de":"Ich habe auch nicht viel Geld.","en":"I don't have much money either.","fa":"من هم پول زیادی ندارم."},{"s":55.83,"e":57.82,"de":"Ja, sehr gerne!","en":"Yeah, I'd love to.","fa":"بله، با کمال میل!"},{"s":57.96,"e":58.71,"de":"Cool!","en":"Cool!","fa":"عالی …"},{"s":78.67,"e":79.23,"de":"So …","en":"So...","fa":"خب."},{"s":87.34,"e":88.66,"de":"Das Hemd ist toll.","en":"That shirt's great.","fa":"پیراهن عالی است."},{"s":89.2,"e":90.14,"de":"Ja, das gefällt mir.","en":"Yeah, I like that.","fa":"بله، خوشم می‌آید."},{"s":93.14,"e":93.92,"de":"Die Jacke auch?","en":"The jacket, too?","fa":"ژاکت هم؟"},{"s":93.94,"e":94.96,"de":"Super.","en":"Great.","fa":"عالی."},{"s":96.99,"e":98.17,"de":"Nein, die ist besser.","en":"No, it's better.","fa":"نه، این بهتر است."},{"s":104.13,"e":104.58,"de":"Wie süß!","en":"How sweet!","fa":"چه بامزه!"},{"s":104.2,"e":105.18,"de":"Wie findest du die Farbe?","en":"What do you think of the color?","fa":"رنگش را چطور می‌بینی؟"},{"s":1